window.SD_INDEX=[{"page": "Home", "title": "Your first car should also be your best driving teacher.", "url": "index.html#top", "text": "Meet The ONE · the first car built for new drivers Your first car should also be your best driving teacher. SAFEDRIVE ONE is a compact electric car with a built-in AI coach. It talks you through every trip, watches the road with you and helps you build safe habits from day one. Explore the car Watch the video The ONE in Deep Navy with Safety Green lines AI-generated"}, {"page": "Home", "title": "Why new drivers choose The ONE", "url": "index.html#why", "text": "Why new drivers choose The ONE The first year behind the wheel is when drivers learn the most and when mistakes are most likely. We designed every part of The ONE around that year. A coach in every trip A calm AI voice gives short, helpful tips, such as “school zone ahead, slow down”, and praises good driving. Safety that steps in Automatic braking, lane help and a 360° camera watch the road even when you miss something. Clean electric power Zero exhaust emissions, low running costs and quiet driving for UAE cities. Peace of mind for families The Parent App shares a weekly safety score, not your live location, so trust grows on both sides."}, {"page": "Home", "title": "Watch: Learn safe. Drive safe.", "url": "index.html#video", "text": "Watch: Learn safe. Drive safe. Our 30-second advert shows The ONE and its AI coach on a morning drive through the UAE. 30-second advert · storyboard 0–8 s: The ONE is revealed AI-generated 8–15 s: the AI coach praises the driver AI-generated 15–23 s: rear view, tail lights glow AI-generated 23–30 s: badge, logo and tagline AI-generated Voice-over: “Every great driver was once a new driver. Meet The ONE, the first car with an AI coach that rides with you, watches the road with you and celebrates every safe trip. Clean, electric and built for the UAE. SAFEDRIVE ONE. Learn safe. Drive safe.”"}, {"page": "Home", "title": "Explore SAFEDRIVE ONE", "url": "index.html#explore", "text": "Explore SAFEDRIVE ONE The ONE, side view AI-generated The Car Design, colours, range and what is inside. See the car → The AI coach screen AI-generated AI Driving Coach How the coach talks, learns and helps you improve. Meet the coach → Sensors watching every side AI-generated Safety Systems Six systems that help stop accidents before they happen. See safety → The ONE, ready for the road AI-generated Safe Driving Guide Our top tips for new drivers on UAE roads. Read the guide →"}, {"page": "About Us", "title": "We started with one question: why is the first car not made for the first year?", "url": "about.html#top", "text": "About SAFEDRIVE ONE We started with one question: why is the first car not made for the first year? SAFEDRIVE ONE is a UAE car company with one goal: to help every new driver become a safe, confident driver. We build one car, The ONE, and we build it only for learners and new drivers. The ONE, our first and only car AI-generated"}, {"page": "About Us", "title": "Our story", "url": "about.html#story", "text": "Our story Most cars are designed for experienced drivers. New drivers get the same car, the same speed and the same distractions, but without the years of practice. Our founders, a team of engineers, driving instructors and designers, saw this gap and asked a simple question: what if the car could teach? In 2026 we began designing The ONE in Dubai. Every feature started with a real moment new drivers find hard: joining a busy highway, driving at night, a sudden sandstorm or the temptation to check a phone. Today The ONE combines an AI coach, smart safety systems and clean electric power in one friendly, affordable car. The final design of The ONE, rear view AI-generated"}, {"page": "About Us", "title": "Mission and values", "url": "about.html#mission", "text": "Mission and values Our mission: to help every new driver become a safe, confident driver, and to reduce accidents caused by inexperience. Safety first Every design choice is tested against one question: does it help a new driver stay safe? Teach, do not punish Our AI coach encourages and explains. It never shames the driver for a mistake. Respect privacy Drivers own their data. Parents see safety scores, not live location. Care for the planet The ONE is fully electric and uses recycled materials inside the cabin."}, {"page": "About Us", "title": "Our journey", "url": "about.html#journey", "text": "Our journey The idea Engineers and driving instructors meet to study why new drivers find the first year so hard. Designing the coach The team designs an AI voice coach that gives short, calm tips instead of loud alarms. Building The ONE The first compact electric car built only for new drivers takes shape. Launch in the UAE The ONE and the Parent App launch for families across the Emirates."}, {"page": "The Car", "title": "Small outside. Smart inside. Made for your first year.", "url": "the-car.html#top", "text": "Feature 1 · The Car Small outside. Smart inside. Made for your first year. The ONE is a compact electric hatchback. It is easy to park, easy to see out of and full of technology that helps you learn. The ONE, side view AI-generated"}, {"page": "The Car", "title": "Designed to feel easy", "url": "the-car.html#design", "text": "Designed to feel easy Big windows and a high seat give you a clear view of the road. Short front and back ends make parking simple, and the 360° camera shows everything around you on the main screen. Inside, there are no confusing menus. One large touchscreen shows the road, your coach and your trip. Physical buttons control the most important things, like hazard lights and air conditioning, so your eyes stay on the road. The cabin uses seat fabric made from recycled bottles and a cool-touch dashboard designed for the UAE summer. Inside The ONE: recycled fabric seats and one large screen AI-generated"}, {"page": "The Car", "title": "How The ONE works", "url": "the-car.html#how-it-works", "text": "How The ONE works Forward sensors watch the road, an AI computer runs the driving coach, a flat battery sits low in the floor for stability, and an electric motor drives the wheels. How The ONE works: sensors, AI coach, battery and stability control AI-generated"}, {"page": "The Car", "title": "Choose your colour", "url": "the-car.html#colours", "text": "Deep Navy with Safety Green lines and LED tail lights AI-generated Choose your colour Every colour has bright green safety lines and LED lights so other drivers can see you clearly, day and night. Deep Navy Pearl White Safety Green Desert Silver Light colours like Pearl White and Desert Silver also stay cooler in the sun."}, {"page": "The Car", "title": "Key specifications", "url": "the-car.html#specs", "text": "Key specifications These numbers are design targets for our concept car. Feature The ONE Type Compact 5-door electric hatchback Seats 5 Driving range Up to 400 km per charge Fast charging 10% to 80% in about 30 minutes Learner speed limit Adjustable, set in the Parent App Safety systems Auto-brake, lane help, tiredness alert, phone lock, 360° camera Emissions Zero exhaust emissions"}, {"page": "AI Coach", "title": "A calm voice that rides with you on every trip.", "url": "ai-coach.html#top", "text": "Feature 2 · AI Driving Coach A calm voice that rides with you on every trip. The AI coach watches the road with you and gives short, friendly tips at the right moment. It learns how you drive and helps you improve, one trip at a time. A live tip from the AI coach AI-generated"}, {"page": "AI Coach", "title": "How the coach works", "url": "ai-coach.html#how", "text": "How the coach works It sees Cameras and sensors read the road, signs, speed and the distance to other cars. It understands The AI compares what is happening with safe driving patterns and your own habits. It speaks It gives one short tip at a time, only when it helps, and never during a hard manoeuvre. It reviews After each trip you get a short summary with one thing done well and one thing to practise. The coach speaks through the cabin speakers AI-generated"}, {"page": "AI Coach", "title": "What the coach might say", "url": "ai-coach.html#examples", "text": "What the coach might say Approaching a school zone “School zone ahead. Let’s slow down and watch for children.” Following too closely “The car in front is close. Leave a little more space.” After a smooth trip “Great trip! Your braking was smooth all the way home.” Late at night “You have been driving for two hours. A short break would help you stay alert.”"}, {"page": "AI Coach", "title": "Three coaching levels", "url": "ai-coach.html#levels", "text": "Three coaching levels As you improve, the coach talks less and trusts you more. Learner Frequent, simple tips and lower speed settings. Best for the first months. Improving Tips only for new or tricky situations, plus weekly goals. Confident The coach stays quiet unless something important happens. Good to know: the coach helps, but you are always the driver. Stay alert and follow the road rules."}, {"page": "Safety", "title": "Six systems watching the road, so you never drive alone.", "url": "safety.html#top", "text": "Feature 3 · Safety Systems Six systems watching the road, so you never drive alone. The ONE uses sensors, cameras and AI to spot danger early. If a crash is close, it warns you first and then helps you brake or steer. Sensors watch every side of the car AI-generated"}, {"page": "Safety", "title": "The six safety systems", "url": "safety.html#systems", "text": "The six safety systems Automatic emergency braking If a car, person or object is suddenly in front of you, The ONE warns you and brakes if you do not react in time. Lane help The car gently guides you back if you drift out of your lane without using the indicator. Tiredness alert A small camera notices signs of tiredness, such as long blinks, and suggests a break. Phone lock While the car moves, texting and social apps are paused. Calls work hands-free and navigation keeps working. 360° camera See all around the car when parking or turning in narrow streets. Learner speed limit Families can set a top speed while the driver is still learning."}, {"page": "Safety", "title": "Seeing people first", "url": "safety.html#crossing", "text": "The ONE slows down for a family at a crossing AI-generated Seeing people first Pedestrians and cyclists are the hardest to see, especially at dusk. The ONE’s cameras are trained to spot people near the road and give an early warning before a crossing. If the driver does not slow down, automatic braking helps stop the car. Remember: safety systems support you but do not replace careful driving. Always look, slow down and give way to pedestrians."}, {"page": "Safety", "title": "Emergency SOS Camera", "url": "safety.html#sos", "text": "Emergency SOS Camera If a crash happens, every second counts. The ONE is designed to call for help by itself, even if the driver cannot. Crash detected: the car starts an SOS alert AI-generated Crash detected Sensors feel a sudden impact or airbag release. Video saved The front and cabin cameras keep a short video from just before and after the crash. SOS sent The car sends an alert with its exact GPS location and the video to emergency services, such as Dubai Police. Help on the way The screen tells the driver that help is coming and keeps the line open. Drivers can also press the red SOS button above the mirror at any time. Privacy first The emergency camera only sends video and location when a crash is detected or the SOS button is pressed. At all other times, nothing is shared, so our privacy promise stays true. Concept feature: SAFEDRIVE ONE is a fictional brand made for a student project. It has no real partnership with Dubai Police. In the UAE, call 999 for police and 998 for an ambulance. The emergency camera records and sends the location AI-generated"}, {"page": "Safety", "title": "Safe Stop Assist", "url": "safety.html#safe-stop", "text": "Safe Stop: the car parks safely and calls for help AI-generated Safe Stop Assist Falling asleep at the wheel is one of the most dangerous things that can happen on a long drive. Safe Stop Assist steps in when the driver cannot. Notices tiredness The driver camera sees long blinks, head nodding or drifting in the lane. Warns the driver A sound, seat vibration and the coach say: “You look tired. Let’s find a safe place to stop.” Stops safely If there is no response, hazard lights turn on and the car slowly moves to the hard shoulder and stops. Tries to wake the driver Alarms, flashing lights and the coach calling the driver’s name. Calls an ambulance If the driver does not respond within 5 minutes, or the camera sees no movement at all, the car calls for an ambulance with its location straight away."}, {"page": "Driving Guide", "title": "Ten habits that make you a safer driver from day one.", "url": "driving-guide.html#top", "text": "Feature 4 · Safe Driving Guide Ten habits that make you a safer driver from day one. Every new driver makes mistakes. These tips help you avoid the most common ones on UAE roads, in any car. Check your seatbelt, mirrors and phone before you drive AI-generated"}, {"page": "Driving Guide", "title": "Top 10 tips for new drivers", "url": "driving-guide.html#top-tips", "text": "Top 10 tips for new drivers Wear your seatbelt on every trip Make sure every passenger wears one too, including in the back seats. Put your phone away Set your music and navigation before you start, then do not touch the phone. Follow the speed limit signs Limits change between roads and areas. Slow down more in rain, fog or heavy traffic. Keep a safe distance Leave a gap of at least a few seconds to the car in front, and more at high speed. Use your indicators early Signal before every lane change or turn so others know what you will do. Check your mirrors and blind spots Look over your shoulder before changing lanes on busy highways. Take roundabouts slowly Choose your lane early and give way to traffic already on the roundabout. Rest when you feel tired Long drives at night are risky. Stop for a break if your eyes feel heavy. Prepare for the heat Check tyre pressure and coolant, and keep water in the car in summer. Stay calm Do not race or react to aggressive drivers. Let them go and keep your own pace."}, {"page": "Driving Guide", "title": "Driving in a sandstorm or fog", "url": "driving-guide.html#sandstorm", "text": "Driving in a sandstorm or fog Sandstorms and morning fog can cut visibility very quickly in the UAE. Slow down smoothly and turn on your low-beam headlights. Increase your distance from the car in front. Do not stop in a traffic lane. If you must stop, move fully off the road where it is safe. Follow the guidance of police and official traffic messages. Lights on and speed down in a sandstorm AI-generated"}, {"page": "Driving Guide", "title": "Driving at night", "url": "driving-guide.html#night", "text": "Bright tail lights help drivers behind you at night AI-generated Driving at night At night it is harder to judge distance and to see people walking. Keep your headlights on, clean your windscreen and avoid looking straight at bright lights coming towards you. New drivers should practise night driving on familiar roads with an experienced driver before long trips. Always check the official rules. Road rules and fines can change. Check the latest information from official UAE traffic authorities, such as the RTA or the police, before you drive."}, {"page": "Parent App", "title": "Support your new driver without watching every move.", "url": "parent-app.html#top", "text": "Feature 5 · Parent App Support your new driver without watching every move. The free SAFEDRIVE ONE app lets families set learner settings and see a weekly safety score. It helps parents support young drivers while respecting their privacy. Families can relax when safe habits are built early AI-generated"}, {"page": "Parent App", "title": "What the app does", "url": "parent-app.html#features", "text": "What the app does Weekly safety score A simple score out of 100 based on braking, speed, phone use and night trips. Learner settings Set a top speed, switch on phone lock and choose the coaching level. Shared goals Parents and drivers agree on one goal each week, like smoother braking. Privacy by design No live location tracking. The driver can see everything the parent sees."}, {"page": "Parent App", "title": "Settings that grow with the driver", "url": "parent-app.html#settings", "text": "Settings that grow with the driver In the first months, families may choose stricter settings. As the safety score improves, the app suggests relaxing them, so the young driver earns more freedom. Both the parent and the driver get the same weekly report. This keeps the app about learning together, not about spying. Our privacy promise: trip details stay with the driver. Parents see scores and settings only. Learner settings are applied in the car AI-generated"}, {"page": "Contact Us", "title": "Questions, test drives or feedback? We would love to hear from you.", "url": "contact.html#top", "text": "Contact Us Questions, test drives or feedback? We would love to hear from you. Send us a message using the form below, call our team or visit the SAFEDRIVE ONE Centre in Dubai. See The ONE at our Dubai showroom AI-generated"}, {"page": "Contact Us", "title": "Send us a message", "url": "contact.html#form", "text": "Send us a message Full name Email Topic Book a test drive Question about The ONE Parent App help Feedback Message Send message Thank you! Your message has been checked and is ready. This is a student project website, so messages are not really sent. Contact details Address SAFEDRIVE ONE Centre, Dubai, United Arab Emirates Phone +971 4 000 0000 Email hello@safedriveone.ae Opening hours Sunday to Thursday, 9:00 to 18:00 Follow us Instagram X YouTube TikTok Book a test drive and try the AI coach AI-generated"}];